00:52:43,440 --> 00:52:44,410
-I don't know.

1562
00:52:44,410 --> 00:52:46,880
It's-- . it's just that--

1563
00:52:46,880 --> 00:52:48,210
-I don't know.

1564
00:52:48,210 --> 00:52:50,480
--that I feel so much--

1565
00:52:50,480 --> 00:52:51,470
[MUFFLED]

1566
00:52:55,600 --> 00:52:56,820
-You got my tongue.

1567
00:52:56,820 --> 00:52:59,260
