-Hurts, don't it?

1587
00:53:58,510 --> 00:54:00,000
-Good scream.

1588
00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:02,050
-Sounds like an
 alligator mauling Bob.

1589
00:54:05,890 --> 00:54:06,750
