1591
00:54:07,350 --> 00:54:09,780
I can't believe it, Wally.

1592
00:54:09,780 --> 00:54:11,370
There's a foreign
 object in the ring.

1593
00:54:11,370 --> 00:54:12,890
he's gonna do--
 oh, a pile driver.

1594
00:54:12,890 --> 00:54:13,390
Oh no.

1595
00:54:13,390 --> 00:54:13,890
-Oh, no.

1596
00:54:13,890 --> 00:54:16,590
If you rub my belly-- my nerve
 endings are all down there.

1597
00:54:16,590 --> 00:54:19,070
-Oh, gotcha.

1598
00:54:19,070 --> 00:54:21,480
-It looks like Dr. Moto's
 got a strangle hold on him.

1599
00:54:24,660 --> 00:54:25,720
-Oh.

1600
00:54:25,720 --> 00:54:28,590
-That's not fair.

1601
00:54:28,590 --> 00:54:31,510
-Oh, he used a foreign
 object all right.

1602
00:54:31,510 --> 00:54:35,300
-I was wondering if we could
 finish our walk la-- later.

1603
00:54:35,300 --> 00:54:37,560
-He's down.

1604
00:54:37,560 --> 00:54:38,490
-Oh, Ralph.

1605
00:54:38,490 --> 00:54:39,020
Ralph, Ralph.

1606
00:54:39,020 --> 00:54:39,690
-Get out of the way.

1607
00:54:39,690 --> 00:54:41,020
