1610
00:54:42,670 --> 00:54:43,780
Look at that.

1611
00:54:43,780 --> 00:54:44,420
Oh, yuck.

1612
00:54:47,410 --> 00:54:48,900
Good job, Blondie.

1613
00:54:51,640 --> 00:54:53,630
-Everyone, Ralph's dead.

1614
00:54:53,630 --> 00:54:55,380
-They are everyone.

1615
00:54:55,380 --> 00:54:57,590
-Oh.

1616
00:54:57,590 --> 00:54:59,280
Here just set him
 here on this body bag.

1617
00:54:59,280 --> 00:55:01,140
