-No.

1656
00:56:28,070 --> 00:56:30,290
Oh Ralph, no!

1657
00:56:30,290 --> 00:56:30,790
-Oh.

1658
00:56:30,790 --> 00:56:32,990
Need a bigger gun.

1659
00:56:32,990 --> 00:56:34,830
Whoa.

1660
00:56:34,830 --> 00:56:35,750
-He solarized him.

1661
00:56:35,750 --> 00:56:39,780
