 big since the Nixon years.

1662
00:56:39,780 --> 00:56:41,160
-Nyuk, nyuk, nyuk.

1663
00:56:41,160 --> 00:56:42,680
That would be a [INAUDIBLE].

1664
00:56:42,680 --> 00:56:44,040
-Mm-hmm.

1665
00:56:44,040 --> 00:56:44,850
-Help me!

1666
00:56:44,850 --> 00:56:47,990
Help me!

1667
00:56:47,990 --> 00:56:50,020
-Where is everybody?

1668
00:56:50,020 --> 00:56:52,430
