 you're all right now.

1673
00:57:05,390 --> 00:57:08,100
-Help me, help me.

1674
00:57:08,100 --> 00:57:09,640
-You've been here all alone?

1675
00:57:09,640 --> 00:57:10,830
-80-foot bugs give
