1678
00:57:15,290 --> 00:57:17,000
-Well, I'm all right now.

1679
00:57:17,000 --> 00:57:18,430
-Is he OK?

1680
00:57:18,430 --> 00:57:19,850
-Nah.

1681
00:57:19,850 --> 00:57:21,890
-I've got a headache
 this big, and it's

1682
