1705
00:58:18,600 --> 00:58:20,110
-That's Joe.

1706
00:58:20,110 --> 00:58:20,970
-Hello, Joe.

1707
00:58:20,970 --> 00:58:21,750
What do you know?

1708
00:58:21,750 --> 00:58:22,500
-Hey, Joe.

1709
00:58:22,500 --> 00:58:23,450
Go investigate the lady.

1710
00:58:23,450 --> 00:58:24,700
Wake her up, boy.

1711
00:58:24,700 --> 00:58:25,200
-Hey.

1712
00:58:25,200 --> 00:58:27,130
-He's hungry.

1713
00:58:27,130 --> 00:58:28,510
-Oh, hi.

1714
00:58:28,510 --> 00:58:30,560
Boy am i glad you're back.

1715
00:58:30,560 --> 00:58:32,610
Did you have a good trip?

1716
00:58:32,610 --> 00:58:35,630
-Lovely if you like walking.

1717
00:58:35,630 --> 00:58:37,630
-Anything usual, Dick?

1718
00:58:37,630 --> 00:58:39,060
[LAUGHTER]

1719
00:58:39,060 --> 00:58:40,640
-What's unusual anymore?

1720
00:58:40,640 --> 00:58:42,550
