1732
00:59:02,570 --> 00:59:03,910
It tastes kind of gamy.

1733
00:59:03,910 --> 00:59:05,110
-And a little stringy.

1734
00:59:05,110 --> 00:59:06,210
-Yeah.

1735
00:59:06,210 --> 00:59:07,610
-They ate the lemur.

1736
00:59:07,610 --> 00:59:09,030
