1739
00:59:12,480 --> 00:59:13,420
-Ugh.

1740
00:59:13,420 --> 00:59:14,280
-Oh!

1741
00:59:14,280 --> 00:59:16,380
--this place will
 support a lot of people.

1742
00:59:16,380 --> 00:59:18,420
If we had to stay here
 for any length of time,

1743
00:59:18,420 --> 00:59:21,030
we should be able to live off
