 I can still handle a gun.

1783
01:00:29,710 --> 01:00:30,770
-Oh, don't be silly, Ralph.

1784
01:00:30,770 --> 01:00:32,130
You need your rest.

1785
01:00:32,130 --> 01:00:33,620
Look, maybe we
 don't need a watch.

1786
01:00:33,620 --> 01:00:35,740
