1793
01:00:55,050 --> 01:00:56,280
Who would have thought it?

1794
01:00:56,280 --> 01:00:58,930
-Yeah, crummy little--
 I have to sit up here.

1795
01:00:58,930 --> 01:01:02,380
Where the hell'd
 the bee go anyway?

1796
01:01:02,380 --> 01:01:03,270
-It "bee" gone.

1797
01:01:05,850 --> 01:01:10,020
-I have to sit here,
 don't even have my roid

1798
01:01:10,020 --> 01:01:11,420
cushion and anything.

1799
01:01:16,500 --> 01:01:17,870
-Heh, cute old lemur.

1800
01:01:17,870 --> 01:01:20,250
