1801
01:01:20,250 --> 01:01:21,730
-Ha, ha.

1802
01:01:21,730 --> 01:01:23,690
Kooky.

1803
01:01:23,690 --> 01:01:25,810
-Here, suck on a
 little JD, buddy.

1804
01:01:25,810 --> 01:01:27,920
-Hi, I'm back.

1805
01:01:27,920 --> 01:01:29,150
Let's watch the fun, huh?

1806
01:01:29,150 --> 01:01:32,170
Yeah, dig it.

1807
01:01:32,170 --> 01:01:32,900
Come on, finish it.

1808
01:01:32,900 --> 01:01:33,460
Finish it.

1809
01:01:33,460 --> 01:01:33,990
-Chug it.

1810
01:01:33,990 --> 01:01:34,490
Chug.

1811
01:01:34,490 --> 01:01:34,990
Chug.

1812
01:01:34,990 --> 01:01:37,100
-Cannon ball.

1813
01:01:37,100 --> 01:01:38,250
-Whoa.

1814
01:01:38,250 --> 01:01:41,050
-Hey, save some for daddy.

1815
01:01:41,050 --> 01:01:42,890
No, Daddy needs his medicine.

1816
01:01:42,890 --> 01:01:44,660
Uh-huh.

1817
01:01:44,660 --> 01:01:46,170
-Hey, give me some of that.

1818
01:01:46,170 --> 01:01:47,020
I invented JD.

1819
01:01:50,160 --> 01:01:52,460
-Cute little guy there.

