 along the beach.

2087
01:11:29,710 --> 01:11:31,380
Ah, that's my rec room.

2088
01:11:31,380 --> 01:11:31,910
Excuse the mess.

2089
01:11:31,910 --> 01:11:33,570
Just throw that skin anywhere.

2090
01:11:33,570 --> 01:11:35,910
And before you take me into
 your heart, I should mention,

2091
01:11:35,910 --> 01:11:36,610
I eat my young.

2092
01:11:36,610 --> 01:11:37,590
Did I say that before?

2093
01:11:37,590 --> 01:11:38,560
-Joe?

2094
01:11:38,560 --> 01:11:40,010
Where's Joe?

2095
01:11:40,010 --> 01:11:41,240
-Ah, just minding
 my own business,

2096
01:11:41,240 --> 01:11:44,320
