2097
01:11:44,320 --> 01:11:45,280
-I'll get him.

2098
01:11:45,280 --> 01:11:46,730
-Dick, don't go.

2099
01:11:46,730 --> 01:11:48,790
-Go back for the lemur.

2100
01:11:48,790 --> 01:11:50,640
-Unloaded.

2101
01:11:50,640 --> 01:11:52,680
-We may have to shoot
 with that camera.

2102
01:11:52,680 --> 01:11:55,140
-Dick!

2103
01:11:55,140 --> 01:11:57,070
-Darn fool kid.

2104
01:11:57,070 --> 01:11:58,560
[SCREAMING]

2105
01:11:58,560 --> 01:11:59,560
-Dick!

2106
01:11:59,560 --> 01:12:02,350
-Damn lemur did this to me.

2107
01:12:02,350 --> 01:12:03,650
-I can see you.

2108
01:12:03,650 --> 01:12:06,900
Don't get me mad.

2109
01:12:06,900 --> 01:12:08,830
-Have a little fire, scarecrow.

2110
01:12:14,120 --> 01:12:18,040
