 for love, Steve.

2111
01:12:18,040 --> 01:12:19,050
[WHISTLING]

2112
01:12:19,050 --> 01:12:20,220
-Hey, nice chest, pal.

2113
01:12:20,220 --> 01:12:20,990
-Not half bad.

2114
01:12:23,770 --> 01:12:24,700
-Oh.

2115
01:12:24,700 --> 01:12:26,300
-And can you believe it?

2116
01:12:26,300 --> 01:12:28,080
I pay 1800 a week
 for that place.

2117
01:12:30,820 --> 01:12:32,290
-Oh, dropping rocks.

2118
01:12:36,720 --> 01:12:40,170
[CLEARING THROAT]

2119
01:12:40,170 --> 01:12:41,440
-Oh, we've got to split.

2120
01:12:41,440 --> 01:12:42,390
-Oh, yeah?

2121
01:12:42,390 --> 01:12:42,890
-OK.

2122
01:12:42,890 --> 01:12:43,850
Come on.

2123
01:12:43,850 --> 01:12:44,610
-Swing it up.

2124
01:12:44,610 --> 01:12:45,410
It says yet.

2125
01:12:45,410 --> 01:12:46,800
Take the shot.

2126
01:12:46,800 --> 01:12:47,760
Count it down.

2127
01:12:59,190 --> 01:13:02,080
NARRATOR: And now it's time
 for another exciting episode

2128
01:13:02,080 --> 01:13:05,010
of emotional scientist,
 starring Joel

2129
01:13:05,010 --> 01:13:06,930
Robinson as Albert Einstein.

2130
01:13:06,930 --> 01:13:12,150
-Oh, let's see here, I've almost
 got the Theory of Relativity.

2131
01:13:12,150 --> 01:13:17,030
Oh, that just makes me so sad
 when I-- (DROPPING ACCENT)

2132
01:13:17,030 --> 01:13:20,080
I can't do this, you guys.

2133
01:13:20,080 --> 01:13:21,130
I don't--

2134
01:13:21,130 --> 01:13:22,310
NARRATOR: Joel,
 what's the matter?

2135
01:13:22,310 --> 01:13:24,610
-I can't-- for one thing, I
 can't do an Albert Einstein.

2136
01:13:24,610 --> 01:13:26,420
I sound like an East Indian.

2137
01:13:26,420 --> 01:13:29,100
And I don't see
 why I always have

2138
01:13:29,100 --> 01:13:31,520
