 up in the dumb costumes.

2139
01:13:31,520 --> 01:13:32,660
I don't get it.

2140
01:13:32,660 --> 01:13:34,540
-What's the matter with you?

2141
01:13:34,540 --> 01:13:37,260
Don't you know what it is
