 your dear little heart out?

2144
01:13:43,370 --> 01:13:44,800
[SOBBING]

2145
01:13:44,800 --> 01:13:48,720
-Crow, you are becoming so camp,
 you make me want to throw up.

2146
01:13:48,720 --> 01:13:50,490
Now listen, if you
 guys want to go on

2147
01:13:50,490 --> 01:13:52,010
with your little
 irrelevant sketches

2148
01:13:52,010 --> 01:13:54,920
