 little costumes and makeup,

2149
01:13:54,920 --> 01:13:55,520
go right ahead.

2150
01:13:55,520 --> 01:13:57,150
But just count me
 out of it, all right?

2151
01:13:57,150 --> 01:13:58,350
NARRATOR: Now wait,
 at least you can

2152
01:13:58,350 --> 01:13:59,440
hold up the title card for us.

2153
01:13:59,440 --> 01:14:00,500
Geez.

2154
01:14:00,500 --> 01:14:01,290
OK, come on.

2155
01:14:01,290 --> 01:14:02,070
Clear it, people.

2156
01:14:02,070 --> 01:14:05,530
We've got a sketch to do.

2157
01:14:05,530 --> 01:14:09,390
And now it's time for another
 exciting episode of Emotional

2158
01:14:09,390 --> 01:14:14,220
Scientist, starring
 Crow as Madame Curie.

2159
01:14:14,220 --> 01:14:17,810
-Well, I should be discovering
 the theory of radium

2160
01:14:17,810 --> 01:14:18,810
pretty soon, I think.

2161
01:14:18,810 --> 01:14:22,010
And then I'm going to go to
 that Jerry Lewis Film Festival.

2162
01:14:22,010 --> 01:14:23,100
Oh, what's the use?

2163
01:14:23,100 --> 01:14:24,090
I'm having a bad day.

2164
01:14:24,090 --> 01:14:25,780
Nobody understands my needs.

2165
01:14:25,780 --> 01:14:28,620
It's that time of--
 (DROPPING ACCENT) oh, geez.

2166
01:14:28,620 --> 01:14:29,640
You know, Joel's right.

2167
01:14:29,640 --> 01:14:33,600
I can't even do a good
 accent on this thing either.

2168
01:14:33,600 --> 01:14:34,350
Get this thing off me.

2169
