I quit.

2170
01:14:35,410 --> 01:14:36,030
-He's right.

2171
01:14:36,030 --> 01:14:36,570
You're right.

2172
01:14:36,570 --> 01:14:39,330
We've been fools to think
 that robots can be actors.

2173
01:14:39,330 --> 01:14:40,580
We're trapped in outer space.

2174
01:14:40,580 --> 01:14:43,370
We couldn't even go to New
 York and study with Uta Hagen

2175
01:14:43,370 --> 01:14:44,230
if we wanted to.

2176
01:14:44,230 --> 01:14:48,210
[SOBBING]

2177
01:14:48,210 --> 01:14:49,840
-Oh.

2178
01:14:49,840 --> 01:14:51,240
Come on, you guys.

2179
01:14:51,240 --> 01:14:53,710
Please, don't be like that.

2180
01:14:53,710 --> 01:14:56,820
I can't stand to see
 you so upset like this.

2181
01:14:56,820 --> 01:14:57,510
I'm sorry.

2182
01:14:57,510 --> 01:15:00,600
I know-- OK, I realize
 that these sketches

2183
01:15:00,600 --> 01:15:01,380
