2190
01:15:11,270 --> 01:15:12,650
I like you guys a lot too.

2191
01:15:12,650 --> 01:15:16,630
And I know two robots and a
 human that have a sketch to do.

2192
01:15:16,630 --> 01:15:17,810
-Oh, boy.

2193
01:15:17,810 --> 01:15:21,200
NARRATOR: And Now it's time
 for another exciting episode

2194
01:15:21,200 --> 01:15:25,600
of Emotional Scientist, starring
 Joel Robinson as Jerry Lewis,

2195
01:15:25,600 --> 01:15:29,890
Crow as Steve Martin, and
 Tom Servo as Enrico Fermi.

2196
01:15:29,890 --> 01:15:31,880
[IMITATING ITALIAN]

2197
01:15:43,310 --> 01:15:45,300
[IMITATING ITALIAN]

2198
01:15:48,280 --> 01:15:49,400
-Thanks for playing along, Joel.

2199
01:15:49,400 --> 01:15:49,900
-That was fun.

2200
