2202
01:15:53,800 --> 01:15:55,400
You think he's going to
 get him for flushing him

2203
01:15:55,400 --> 01:15:56,280
down the toilet?

2204
01:15:56,280 --> 01:15:57,700
-Yep, I think so.

2205
01:16:02,000 --> 01:16:02,620
-Here he goes.

2206
01:16:02,620 --> 01:16:04,880
-Hey, can't you see I'm working
