2213
01:16:17,340 --> 01:16:19,000
-Come on, you knuckle-nob.

2214
01:16:19,000 --> 01:16:20,220
Come on, I got you.

2215
01:16:23,550 --> 01:16:25,030
-Hey, those aren't real tears.

2216
01:16:25,030 --> 01:16:26,480
