2217
01:16:26,480 --> 01:16:27,180
-Yeah, you're right.

2218
01:16:33,830 --> 01:16:34,900
-Nobody's going to believe this.

2219
01:16:34,900 --> 01:16:35,840
-You mean this movie?

2220
01:16:39,370 --> 01:16:42,240
-Hey, Nastacia, kids-- oh, no.

2221
01:16:42,240 --> 01:16:43,130
No.

2222
01:16:43,130 --> 01:16:44,860
Fingers are right, though.

2223
01:16:44,860 --> 01:16:47,860
