2224
01:16:54,110 --> 01:16:54,720
-Oh-ho!

2225
01:16:54,720 --> 01:16:55,500
Leaping lizards.

2226
01:16:55,500 --> 01:16:56,500
-Hey, thanks for the jump cut.

2227
01:16:59,420 --> 01:17:01,170
-I'll just watch from up here.

2228
01:17:01,170 --> 01:17:01,990
-Who's that?

2229
01:17:01,990 --> 01:17:02,830
-The ref.

2230
01:17:02,830 --> 01:17:03,470
That's the ref.

2231
01:17:03,470 --> 01:17:05,150
-Oh.

2232
01:17:05,150 --> 01:17:06,930
-Whoa.

2233
01:17:06,930 --> 01:17:10,900
