2235
01:17:13,090 --> 01:17:14,610
-I'm gonna make a handbag
 out of you, gator.

2236
01:17:18,880 --> 01:17:19,820
-Ouch.

2237
01:17:19,820 --> 01:17:20,590
-Yes, folks.

2238
01:17:20,590 --> 01:17:23,730
Thrill to the exciting,
 the most exciting fight

2239
01:17:23,730 --> 01:17:26,730
