2241
01:17:29,970 --> 01:17:30,860
-Ah!

2242
01:17:30,860 --> 01:17:31,360
-Oh.

2243
01:17:31,360 --> 01:17:32,530
-Hey.

2244
01:17:32,530 --> 01:17:34,680
-Hey, Mr. Lippert, I'm appalled.

2245
01:17:34,680 --> 01:17:36,310
