2246
01:17:36,310 --> 01:17:38,810
-Oh, really.

2247
01:17:38,810 --> 01:17:39,310
-I feel sick.

2248
01:17:39,310 --> 01:17:40,850
-Hand me that very pistol.

2249
01:17:40,850 --> 01:17:42,330
