 of Ralph and Pam?

2251
01:17:44,280 --> 01:17:45,720
-I hate to bring them into this.

2252
01:17:45,720 --> 01:17:46,420
-Better than them us.

2253
01:17:46,420 --> 01:17:47,580
-It's the only way out of here.

2254
01:17:47,580 --> 01:17:48,750
