2277
01:18:39,470 --> 01:18:40,660
-I love those flower baskets.

2278
01:18:40,660 --> 01:18:41,610
-Mm-hmm.

2279
01:18:41,610 --> 01:18:43,440
-Look, the flare.

2280
01:18:43,440 --> 01:18:45,010
-Hm, a red flare, Pat.

2281
01:18:45,010 --> 01:18:47,250
-That means lizard wrestling.

2282
01:18:47,250 --> 01:18:48,970
Red flare at night,
 lizards fight.

2283
01:18:48,970 --> 01:18:52,350
Red flare in the morning,
 lizards take warning.

2284
01:18:52,350 --> 01:18:52,850
Wow.

2285
01:18:55,640 --> 01:18:58,850
-Uh, Mr. Goodwrench, you
 forgot your car battery.

2286
01:18:58,850 --> 01:18:59,950
