2302
01:19:39,040 --> 01:19:41,770
-I think, uh, you better
 do another callback.

2303
01:19:41,770 --> 01:19:42,970
-Will you guys knock
 it off? i can't

2304
01:19:42,970 --> 01:19:45,470
concentrate on my
 own lame wisecracks.

2305
01:19:45,470 --> 01:19:45,970
-Good.

2306
01:19:48,600 --> 01:19:51,400
