 Rex of Earth's prehistoric age.

2337
01:21:12,530 --> 01:21:13,640
-No, it doesn't.

2338
01:21:13,640 --> 01:21:15,050
-Sorry, no way.

2339
01:21:15,050 --> 01:21:16,500
King Dinosaur.

2340
01:21:16,500 --> 01:21:18,050
-Have breakfast with the king.

2341
